{
  "id": 325754199,
  "iid": 17181,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "Qt: Toggle (set/unset) temporary filter color",
  "description": "Temporary filter color are a very nice and helpful feature when analysing a capture. But I couldn't find an easy way to uncolorize a temporary color filter or colored conversation (see user guide section 11.3. Packet colorization). As said, you can add temporary colorizations but nothing about removing it. You may change the color of a conversation, or reasign the color which does not make the color to be removed.\n\nThis patch alows removes the color by simply applying the exact same filter to a temporarily colorized packet: conversation with Ctrl + Number or through field value with right click on a field in packet detail pane.\n\nThis patch only concerns wireshark but may be applied to logray.",
  "state": "merged",
